belian &amp; Rekap PB&#10;• Pencatatan &amp; Pelunasan Hutang&#10;• Tarik Data Master Stok Barang" style="rounded=1;arcSize=18;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shadow=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;strokeWidth=2;fillColor=#f0fdf4;strokeColor=#16a34a;fontColor=#14532d;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="230" width="380" height="130" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p_2_0" value="2.0 PENJUALAN &amp; PIUTANG&#10;&#10;• SPH Keluar &amp; Sales Order Barang&#10;• Laporan Penjualan (Faktur SI)&#10;• Surat Jalan Pengiriman (SJ) &amp; Pelunasan Piutang&#10;• Viewer Rekap Sales Order Barang (Filter Harga)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=18;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shadow=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;strokeWidth=2;fillColor=#fefce8;strokeColor=#ca8a04;fontColor=#713f12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="460" y="230" width="380" height="130" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p_3_0" value="3.0 OPERASIONAL PRODUKSI&#10;&#10;• Tarik Data Produksi Digit (BOM, orders, BBB, Hasil)&#10;• Referensi Order (Digit orders) &amp; 2 Master Pekerjaan&#10;• Input Jadwal Target Produksi &amp; Realisasi JHP (Web &amp; Bot)&#10;• Input &amp; Update Log Tugas Laporan Pekerjaan (7 Divisi)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=18;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shadow=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;strokeWidth=2;fillColor=#fff7ed;strokeColor=#ea580c;fontColor=#7c2d12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="230" width="500" height="130" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p_4_0" value="4.0 KALKULASI &amp; PRICELIST&#10;&#10;• Simulator Pricelist (20+ Kategori Produk Cetak)&#10;• Pencatatan Nilai HPP (/hpp-kalkulasi)&#10;• Sync Nama Order dari Digit orders&#10;• Referensi Tarif dari Rekap Pembelian Barang" style="rounded=1;arcSize=18;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shadow=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;strokeWidth=2;fillColor=#faf5ff;strokeColor=#9333ea;fontColor=#