f_materials,&#10;orders, bahan_baku,&#10;barang_jadi,&#10;produksi_selesai)" style="shape=partialRectangle;top=0;bottom=0;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=9;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="430" width="160" height="110" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ds_d5" value="D5 | Jurnal Produksi&#10;(jurnal_harian_produksi)&#10;[Ref: orders/sopd,&#10;master_pekerjaan,&#10;master_pekerjaan_jurnal_produksi]" style="shape=partialRectangle;top=0;bottom=0;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=9;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1050" y="430" width="160" height="110" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ds_d6" value="D6 | Laporan Pekerjaan&#10;(laporan_pekerjaan,&#10;role_laporan_pekerjaan_config)" style="shape=partialRectangle;top=0;bottom=0;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=9;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1220" y="430" width="160" height="110" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ds_d7" value="D7 | Kalkulasi &amp; Pricelist&#10;(hpp_kalkulasi, pricelist_items,&#10;pricelist_saved_calculations)" style="shape=partialRectangle;top=0;bottom=0;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=9;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1420" y="430" width="360" height="110" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ds_d8" value="D8 | Akuntansi&#10;(rek_akuntansi,&#10;jurnal_umum)" style="shape=partialRectangle;top=0;bottom=0;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=9;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1820" y="430" width="115" height="110" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ds_d9" value="D9 | SDM &amp; Kasus&#10;(employees,&#10;infractions)" style="shape=partialRectangle;top=0;bottom=0;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=9;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1945" y="430" width="115" height="110" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ds_d10" value="D10 | Tata Kelola&#10;(users, app_roles, role_permissions,&#10;telegram_users, activity_logs, usr_log)" style="shape=partialRectangle;top=0;bottom=0;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=9;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2070" y="430" width="115" height="110" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p_audit" value="6.0 TRACKING MANUFAKTUR&#10;&#10;Pelacakan Alur Dokumen Operasional: Pengguna memasukkan No Faktur (BOM / Order Produksi / PO / PB / SO) → Sistem menelusuri alur dokumen otomatis:&#10;Pembelian (PR → SPPH → SPH → PO → Penerimaan → Rekap PB → Hutang) ⇄ Penjualan (SPH Out → Sales Order → Laporan Penjualan → Kirim SJ → Piutang) ⇄ Pabrik (BOM → Order Produksi → Bahan Baku → Barang Jadi)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#4338ca;strokeColor=#312e81;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=10.5;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;shadow=1;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="660" width="1340" height="80" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="dash_support" value="DASHBOARD MONITORING SISTEM&#10;&#10;• Dashboard Akunting: Ringkasan Arus Kas, Laba/Rugi, &amp; Tren Akunting&#10;• Dashboard HRD: Statistik Total Karyawan &amp; Grafik Tren Catat Kesalahan&#10;• Dashboard Produksi: Ringkasan Order &amp; Jurnal, Tren BBB vs Hasil Produksi" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0f172a;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;shadow=1;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometr